      },
      "content": "Figure 17: O-ring for models 3196 and HT 3196",
      "caption_for": "fig_0113"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1145",
      "reading_order": 1312,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 143.99562,
        "t": 142.61460999999997,
        "r": 545.7656200000004,
        "b": 119.37460999999996
      },
      "content": "If  the impeller cannot be removed by the previous methods, cut the shaft between the gland and the frame, remove the impeller, stuffing-box cover, gland, sleeve, and shaft end as a unit. Do not apply heat."
    }
  ],
